[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0234","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0234.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0681","title":"Microsoft FrontPage Personal Web Server 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions（PWS）3.0.2.926 在 Windows 95 及可能其他版本上存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，即可通过向目标 Web 服务器发送特制的超长 URL 请求触发该溢出，导致 PWS 服务进程异常终止，引发拒绝服务（Denial of Service），使 Web 服务完全不可用。该漏洞影响安装了受影响版本 FrontPage Server Extensions 的 Windows 系统，攻击条件简单，仅需向 PWS 的 HTTP 接口发送构造的恶意请求即可完成利用，无需任何登录凭据或特殊权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0681"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:50Z","remediation":"升级 Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions 至 3.0.2.926 之后的修补版本，或安装 Microsoft 针对该缓冲区溢出的官方安全补丁（参考 Microsoft Security Bulletin MS99-0xx 及知识库文章 KB238453）。若无法立即更新，可在 Internet Information Services 或 Personal Web Server 的 URL 验证配置中限制请求 URL 的最大长度，或在防火墙层面禁止外部直接访问 FrontPage Server Extensions 端口（默认 80/443），仅允许内网可信 IP 访问，以此作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/1999-q3/0381.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/568","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3117","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19445","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6bde90e50f9c8511feb5459f87a55fa56411bd2c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0681.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0681","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0681.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d448b12fda744aa8491fddc8705260f2b4289f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0681.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5bd4fceb27857756215e988f4824b12d3de84ec1/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wj24-pvf2-wxpm/GHSA-wj24-pvf2-wxpm.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/979579ffd61606c64cf772a1e865f5126788e4ec/1999.tsv","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/CERTCC/SBOM/blob/ae581e32992458f65018df4eced684b7370bba39/SwiftBOM/cpe_lookup/cve_lookup/microsoft/personal_web_server_cve.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0681.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0234.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0234.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0234.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0025","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0359","title":"Marc Schaefer ptylogin 拒绝服务及密码泄露漏洞","description":"Unix 系统中的 ptylogin 工具存在访问控制缺陷，本地用户可通过操纵伪终端设备锁定调制解调器，导致合法用户无法拨入（拒绝服务）；亦可利用该缺陷以调制解调器身份向外拨号，或截获拨入用户的登录密码。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，影响所有使用 ptylogin 管理串行拨号会话的 Unix 系统，攻击者需具备本地 shell 访问权限即可实施攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0359"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:13Z","remediation":"立即升级 ptylogin 至最新安全版本；同时移除 ptylogin 二进制文件的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/ptylogin），并将可执行权限限制为仅授权用户组。对调制解调器设备文件（/dev/ttyS*、/dev/modem）设置 600 权限，仅允许 root 和拨号用户组访问。实施回拨认证机制作为临时缓解措施，并建议用 SSH 或 VPN 替代基于调制解调器的远程接入方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0359","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ead50dc12e50bdd7f50b53d9d01c9f9946862c44/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0359.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0359","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0359.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ed191c1149de50e461e9a357f4a3a22e603f0d1/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0359.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b7a93df7f7051799495805bc211adea8d202dae7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vwjf-9p53-995f/GHSA-vwjf-9p53-995f.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0359.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82482/info.html","https://github.com/zephyros1603/RadiantProcessors/blob/7d44cb1cd4b9e088fbe463f1b19be50a04c2efe8/Backend/RAG/data/allitems.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0681","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0681.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0681","title":"Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions (PWS) 3.0.2.926 在处理超长 URL 时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过发送特制长 URL 请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致目标服务器拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 95 平台上的 Personal Web Server。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0681"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions 已停止维护，建议升级至受支持的现代 Web 服务器平台（如 IIS），或迁移至其他安全的 Web 发布解决方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T10:08:30Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/1999-q3/0381.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/568","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3117"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0681.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0469","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0469.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0756","title":"Macromedia ColdFusion 管理员 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Allaire ColdFusion（现 Adobe ColdFusion）管理控制台在启用高级安全功能后存在权限验证缺陷，远程未经授权的攻击者可通过 Start/Stop 管理工具直接向目标服务器发送停止操作指令，导致 ColdFusion 服务进程被异常终止，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 ColdFusion 4.x 及更早版本，攻击者无需认证即可利用，CVSS v2 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。厂商已发布安全公告并提供修复补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0756"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-03-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2001-03-12T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议升级Adobe ColdFusion至2023或更高版本，并关闭Advanced Security模式或严格限制管理员账户访问权限。通过Web.config配置禁用Start/Stop实用程序功能，作为临时缓解措施可通过防火墙限制针对管理员页面的网络访问，确保仅从内部网络可访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e268305fd8644994d337819e469d1f89bafde833/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0756.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0756","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0756.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/76af88afbb282d6c9e8ce3b9f6942bcb7e39be57/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0756.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d9ad03f9df46533ce9229f9da6bbf66bd77a3f4f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hh79-hq4p-6w7f/GHSA-hh79-hq4p-6w7f.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0756.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/acme/acme_cves.csv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--97e85f41-5b9b-4be5-b3f7-3fef80418c08.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0469.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0324","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0324.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0729","title":"Lotus Domino Server 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IBM Lotus Domino 服务器在处理特定网络请求时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于服务器程序未对输入数据长度进行充分的边界校验，远程攻击者可通过向目标 Domino 服务器发送特制的畸形数据包，使数据写入缓冲区边界之外，从而触发服务崩溃并造成拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响运行 Lotus Domino 的服务器系统，攻击无需身份认证，只要网络可达目标服务端口即可发起，利用方式相对简单，可导致邮件与协作服务中断，影响业务连续性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0729"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-03-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2001-03-12T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至最新版本 HCL Domino 12.0.2 或更高版本以修复 Lotus Notes LDAP (NLDAP) 服务的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Domino 服务器配置中禁用 LDAP 服务，或通过防火墙仅允许可信 IP 访问 TCP 389 端口作为临时缓解措施。同时建议定期检查服务器日志中异常的 ldap_search 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0f25967d744704fe14324ac10f2b57e945aed081/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0729.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0729","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0729.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2eb55660fa7a900eec90103b031be5d6f98d9ec/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0729.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1dbd44058e428445290bfb1f6fc6ecc0addbfd35/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q9vv-w9pw-fj27/GHSA-q9vv-w9pw-fj27.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0729.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0324.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0021","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0307","title":"HP HP-UX cstm 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"HP-UX 操作系统中的 cstm（Customer Services Test Manager）程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该程序提交特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，进而覆盖内存中的关键数据，实现权限提升并获得 root 超级用户权限。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 多个版本，攻击者需要具有目标系统的本地访问权限，但无需其他特殊条件，利用难度较低，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0307"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-20T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:07Z","remediation":"立即移除 cstm 程序的 setuid root 权限位：`chmod u-s /opt/sfm/bin/cstm`，仅允许受信任的管理员通过 sudo 执行。如业务允许，可彻底卸载 cstm 软件包：`swremove SFM-CSTM`。若系统仍在运行关键业务无法直接卸载，应使用文件权限 ACL 限制 cstm 的执行用户为 root 组，命令：`chmod 750 /opt/sfm/bin/cstm && chown root:sys /opt/sfm/bin/cstm`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0307"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1197","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1197.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1579","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 Cenroll ActiveX Control 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 的 Cenroll ActiveX 控件（xenroll.dll）存在资源耗尽型拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页，诱导目标用户访问后触发该 ActiveX 控件在目标系统上创建大量任意文件，导致系统磁盘或内存资源被耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 Terminal Server Edition 及 Windows NT Server 4.0（未安装 Service Pack 6 的版本），CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。安装 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6 可修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1579"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:45Z","remediation":"立即将 Windows NT 4.0 Server 及 Terminal Server Edition 升级至 Service Pack 6 (SP6) 或更高版本。SP6 已修复 xenroll.dll ActiveX 控件允许远程创建任意文件导致资源耗尽的问题。如因业务原因无法升级，可在 Internet Explorer 中将 Cenroll 控件 killbit 设为 1 以禁用该 ActiveX 控件，降低攻击面。Windows NT 4.0 已停止支持，建议迁移至受支持的 Windows Server 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3B242366","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/3062","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6827","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7107","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1579.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aac9f724534c8b70ef764b55a2e686a2db6290f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1579.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1579.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1579","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1579.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1579.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1579.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/282ff152724e1965c75ba519262917a137e5f479/1999/CVE-1999-1579.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/35da533508e1fba7c867aa2cd921b3d4db48f5a9/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-15xx/CVE-1999-1579.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/1999.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1197.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1186","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1186.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1563","title":"Nachuatec D435/D445 打印机 ICMP 重定向消息风暴拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Nachuatec D435 与 D445 打印机在处理 ICMP 重定向消息时存在安全缺陷，远程攻击者可向目标设备发送大量特制的 ICMP 重定向报文，触发消息风暴，耗尽设备处理资源，导致打印机服务中断或拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，影响设备正常打印功能，需通过固件更新或禁用 ICMP 重定向功能进行缓解。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1563"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:43Z","remediation":"由于 Nachuatec D435/D445 打印机已停产且厂商不再提供固件更新，建议在网络边界防火墙或路由器上配置 ACL 丢弃入站的 ICMP 重定向报文（类型 5），阻止攻击者从外部发送 ICMP 重定向风暴。同时将打印机隔离至独立 VLAN，限制其与不可信网络的通信。长期解决方案是升级至受支持的打印机型号。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/30849","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/35075","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e37edb84f090321c2ab4b4aefc57f84a75b1b940/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1563.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1563","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1563.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1563.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v993-g7w6-fm39/GHSA-v993-g7w6-fm39.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87914/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1563.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c273ba2c-67dd-48d4-8839-a169524e7817.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1186.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0477","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0477.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0761","title":"FreeBSD fts 库缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统 fts 库例程存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过精心构造的数据触发该漏洞，导致内存越界写入。该漏洞允许攻击者利用 periodic 程序修改任意系统文件，从而提升权限至 root 级别。漏洞影响 FreeBSD 多个版本，攻击者需拥有本地账户权限才能利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0761"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-09-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:00Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 至 3.3 及以上版本，该版本修复了 fts 库函数中的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，限制本地用户对 periodic 程序的执行权限，移除不必要的 cron 任务调用。同时应用系统安全补丁集，确保所有基础库为最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1074","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/644"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0477.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0576","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0576.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0812","title":"Samba smbmnt 竞争条件导致本地用户挂载任意文件系统漏洞","description":"Samba smbmnt 组件存在竞争条件漏洞，本地攻击者可利用 smbmnt 挂载文件系统时的竞争窗口，通过精心构造的时序攻击将文件系统挂载到任意指定位置，从而实现权限提升或文件系统劫持。该漏洞影响运行 Samba smbmnt 组件的 Linux/Unix 系统，攻击者需具备本地用户权限并能调用 smbmnt 命令，利用竞争窗口在挂载操作完成前替换挂载点路径，实现任意路径挂载从而实现权限提升或敏感文件访问。CVSS 评分 7.6，属高危漏洞，建议升级 Samba 至修复版本并限制 smbmnt 执行权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0812"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:06Z","remediation":"建议升级 Samba 至 2.0.7 或更高版本（1999 年 9 月发布的修复版本）。若无法立即升级，可移除 smbmnt 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/smbmnt）或限制普通用户执行权限（chmod 750 /usr/bin/smbmnt），并限制普通用户挂载权限（编辑 /etc/fstab 添加 user,noauto 选项或使用 sudo 限制）作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快升级至 Samba 4.x 以上长期支持版本彻底修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0812","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73dad9db65989a09e468a4f3a98f0eea36f0346c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0812.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0812","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0812.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5297adfba5e91ee22e711c26c523b292d427c0d0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0812.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/90b464bbc2d1b64270a5771429f96b67fbe9e79b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qh4j-xq27-qw86/GHSA-qh4j-xq27-qw86.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0812.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/1999/19990804.data","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2021/samba/gb_samba_mult_vuln_2_0_5.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0812.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0576.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0855","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0855.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1008","title":"Red Hat xsoldier 0.96 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"xsoldier 0.96 是 RedHat Linux 6.2 发行版中附带的 X11 窗口射击游戏，该程序在启动时未对命令行参数长度进行充分边界检查，存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过向 xsoldier 传入超长命令行参数触发堆栈溢出，进而覆盖返回地址并执行任意代码，最终获得系统 root 权限。此漏洞影响 RedHat 6.2 系统上安装 xsoldier 0.96 版本的本地用户，攻击条件要求攻击者已在目标系统上拥有普通用户账户访问权限，利用方式为在命令行中执行带有精心构造的溢出载荷的参数即可完成权限提升。CVSS 评分为 7.2，危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1008"],"sources":["cve","epss"],"published":"2000-05-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:30Z","remediation":"卸载 xsoldier 0.96 游戏或移除其 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/X11R6/bin/xsoldier），建议升级至 Red Hat 7.0 或更高版本，或从红帽官方获取 xsoldier 修补版本进行升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-1008","http://marc.info/?l=freebsd-security&m=94531826621620&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/871","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/229"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/229"],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/229"],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0855.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0084","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0084.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0427","title":"Qualcomm Eudora 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Qualcomm Eudora 邮件客户端（包括 Eudora 4.1/4.2/4.3、Eudora Light 3.0、Eudora Pro 1.0）在处理附件时存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送带有超长文件名的恶意邮件附件触发该漏洞，导致邮件客户端崩溃或拒绝服务。由于对附件文件名字段长度缺乏有效校验，攻击者可构造特制邮件批量发送，使目标用户无法正常使用邮件客户端。该漏洞 CVSS v2 评分 7.5，危害等级高，且可能伴随部分机密性和完整性影响。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0427"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-05-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-05-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Eudora 5.0 或更高版本（5.x/6.x 系列已修复此漏洞），并避免打开来源不明的包含超长附件名的邮件。由于 Eudora 已于 2006 年停止维护，建议迁移至 Thunderbird 等仍在安全更新的邮件客户端以防止后续安全风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e6f80460dd56d97b6079eb72c9467b9a961ce1b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0427.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0427","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0427.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a75ebb477762f54f32c38d85ec939339ec2712e5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0427.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qj8p-hjm8-996j/GHSA-qj8p-hjm8-996j.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0427.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fc880cf5-abcd-4188-8098-16ea76f2ee08.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001327.txt","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0084.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0785","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0785.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0979","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1728,\"inputTokens\":9142,\"outputTokens\":18,\"totalTokens\":10888}}","description":"SCO UnixWare 特权进程系统存在调试器滥用漏洞，本地攻击者可在特权进程执行前，使用 gdb 等调试工具向 _init 函数插入陷阱指令，从而劫持进程执行流获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SCO UnixWare 7.0/7.0.1/7.1/7.1.1 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需其他认证条件即可实施利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0979"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:27Z","remediation":"建议升级至 SCO UnixWare 7.1.1 并安装官方发布的安全补丁 ptf7051（或后续累积补丁），修复特权进程加载机制。作为临时缓解措施，可移除相关特权程序的 setuid/setgid 权限位，限制本地用户对调试器（如 gdb/ptrace）的使用权限，并加强本地账户访问控制，防止未授权用户在特权进程执行前注入调试断点。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94530783815434&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/869","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19674","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e244b55bdff85b2483c0e6a7cecd12f8bee0df6e/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0979.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0979","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0979.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0ea6b1a1298433599abdd2a4c6b6ce9f09476665/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0979.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d9ad03f9df46533ce9229f9da6bbf66bd77a3f4f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5x3w-xm4w-27rq/GHSA-5x3w-xm4w-27rq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0979.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0785.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0280","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0280.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0701","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9106,\"outputTokens\":21,\"totalTokens\":10791}}","description":"Windows NT 4.0 在进行无人值守（unattended）安装时，安装配置文件中可能以明文形式包含本地 Administrator 管理员账户的密码等敏感信息。该漏洞影响所有采用无人值守方式部署的 Windows NT 4.0 系统，攻击条件为攻击者能够访问到安装过程中生成的应答文件（如 unattend.txt 等）。利用方式是攻击者读取该安装文件即可获取 Administrator 密码，进而以最高权限登录并完全控制系统，造成严重的权限泄露与安全隐患。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0701"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:52Z","remediation":"微软已在 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 4 及后续补丁中修复该问题，应立即升级至 SP4 或更高版本；完成无人参与安装后，手动删除分布于磁盘的 Unattend.txt、Winnt.sif 等应答文件，避免其中包含的本地 Administrator 密码等敏感信息泄露；同时在共享与权限配置中禁止对系统分区及 %SystemRoot% 目录的匿名访问，并定期审计已部署镜像中的安装残留文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ173039","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/626","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-036","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8b4df384387a55d60e5ec37568fb4254388bef40/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0701.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0701","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0701.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/30f77465b94d71209b45a239e791a1fe062c9e8b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0701.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c9462134bd15c86fd0ed45fb18bd761cdf938c73/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-26w9-58jr-4jc3/GHSA-26w9-58jr-4jc3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0701.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ce201f9a-05b7-4813-a26f-ecc530d4b35a.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001276.txt","https://github.com/chandanbn/notes/blob/90eb64532f7259c55e5531dfc2726d810d17ef6e/cve5-validation-errors-Jan27.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0280.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0280.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0274","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0274.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0699","title":"Bluestone Sapphire Web Server 会话劫持漏洞","description":"Bluestone Sapphire Web 服务器存在会话劫持漏洞，其会话 ID 生成算法过于简单且可预测，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过枚举或猜测会话 ID 的方式劫持合法用户的会话，从而获取未授权访问权限。该漏洞影响 Bluestone Sapphire Web 服务器的多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，建议升级至修复版本或实施会话加固措施。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0699"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:52Z","remediation":"升级 Bluestone Sapphire Web Server 至最新版本或迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）。在无法升级时，在应用层实施强随机 Session ID 生成机制，并启用 HTTPS 加密传输防止会话劫持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/623","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8b4df384387a55d60e5ec37568fb4254388bef40/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0699.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0699","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0699.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/30f77465b94d71209b45a239e791a1fe062c9e8b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0699.json","https://gith